    "content": "Japan has dominated the World Baseball Classic (WBC), winning three of the first five tournaments (2006, 2009, 2023). Other champions include the Dominican Republic (2013) and the United States (2017). The 2026 champion is Venezuela. The tournament features the world's best professional players from various nations. World Baseball Classic Winners by Year 2006: Japan (defeated Cuba) 2009: Japan (defeated South Korea) 2013: Dominican Republic (defeated Puerto Rico) 2017: United States (defeated Puerto Rico) 2023: Japan (defeated USA) 2026: Venezuela (defeated USA) WBC Championships by Country Japan: 3 (2006, 2009, 2023) Dominican Republic: 1 (2013) United States: 1 (2017) Venezuela: 1 (2026)",
